OL,12,G0005 Naked Attraction
OL,13,     FMake-up artist Callie from Glasgow
OL,14,     Fwants a man who's proud to have
OL,15,     Fher on his arm, while part-time
OL,16,     Flife model Luca from Edinburgh is
OL,17,     Flooking for his perfect muse to
OL,18,     Fsketch.
